WEBVTT

01:30.280 --> 01:34.950
[The Heir]

01:35.410 --> 01:37.880
[Episode 38]

01:39.280 --> 01:40.410
Court is in session.

01:40.560 --> 01:45.150
Hear ye!

01:45.870 --> 01:48.640
Bring in the accused,
Tian and his two sons.

02:00.150 --> 02:02.760
Bring in the accused, Luo Wenqian.

02:12.750 --> 02:13.560
Kneel!

02:20.750 --> 02:22.840
After review, it has been established
that the man known as Qi Jiu

02:22.840 --> 02:26.500
is in fact Luo Wenqian, son of
the convicted traitor Luo Hanzhang.

02:26.590 --> 02:28.190
To escape exile,

02:28.520 --> 02:29.870
he assumed another identity

02:29.870 --> 02:31.910
and served in General Qi's army for years,

02:31.910 --> 02:33.360
deceiving his superiors

02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
and flouting the law.

02:35.310 --> 02:39.310
However, in light of his years
of service managing military provisions

02:39.310 --> 02:41.710
and his role in exposing the Tian family's
illicit foreign trade,

02:41.710 --> 02:45.310
this court sentences him to 20 years

02:45.390 --> 02:47.120
of hard labor in the southwest.

02:47.470 --> 02:50.130
He is not to leave
before his sentence is served.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.310
Luo Wenqian,

02:51.560 --> 02:53.360
do you accept the sentence?

03:00.280 --> 03:01.470
I am Luo Wenqian.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.520
I

03:20.630 --> 03:21.690
accept the charges

03:23.630 --> 03:24.630
and the sentence.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.060
It has been determined

03:33.190 --> 03:37.000
that Tian Benchang, Tian Bensheng,
and Tian Huai'an—

03:37.680 --> 03:39.590
father and two sons—

03:40.240 --> 03:41.960
used their connections
to powerful officials

03:41.960 --> 03:43.310
to disrupt the ink industry

03:43.310 --> 03:45.280
and went so far as to
engage in illicit foreign trade,

03:45.280 --> 03:46.840
committing a grave offense.

03:46.840 --> 03:51.560
I sentence Tian Bensheng and Tian Huai'an

03:51.870 --> 03:53.270
to ten years of hard labor

03:53.560 --> 03:54.960
in the northern territories.

03:54.960 --> 03:58.020
They are not to leave
before their terms are completed.

03:58.030 --> 03:59.000
Do you two

03:59.470 --> 04:01.530
accept the charges and the sentence?

04:01.960 --> 04:02.800
I

04:03.430 --> 04:04.590
do.

04:05.280 --> 04:07.030
I do.

04:09.870 --> 04:11.240
Tian Huai'an's wife

04:11.280 --> 04:14.150
is absent today due to illness.

04:14.280 --> 04:16.720
However, she knowingly concealed
her son's collusion with foreign forces

04:16.720 --> 04:17.910
and failed to report it.

04:17.910 --> 04:20.709
She shall therefore
receive the same punishment.

04:21.829 --> 04:22.830
Tian Ronghua

04:23.160 --> 04:24.160
of the Tian family

04:24.510 --> 04:25.310
has been found

04:25.480 --> 04:27.480
to have no involvement
in the collusion with foreign forces.

04:27.480 --> 04:29.560
Moreover, she rendered meritorious service
by reporting the crime

04:29.560 --> 04:31.020
and shall not be punished.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.530
As for the principal offender,

04:35.720 --> 04:37.120
Tian Benchang:

04:38.900 --> 04:41.530
as head of Tian Ink

04:41.830 --> 04:44.159
and bearer of the Tribute Ink commission,

04:44.600 --> 04:46.800
he knowingly violated the law.

04:46.950 --> 04:48.600
He colluded with foreign forces
for personal gain,

04:48.600 --> 04:50.630
bribed officials to buy influence,

04:50.630 --> 04:51.630
and drove innocent people to their deaths.

04:51.630 --> 04:53.290
His crimes are unforgivable!

04:55.040 --> 04:56.430
I hereby

04:56.680 --> 04:58.190
sentence him to death.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.510
Bravo! Bravo!

05:00.620 --> 05:01.390
Good judgment.

05:01.390 --> 05:02.720
He shall be transferred to
the Ministry of Justice

05:02.720 --> 05:03.720
for final review

05:04.190 --> 05:05.250
and then executed!

05:09.390 --> 05:10.360
Tian Benchang,

05:10.960 --> 05:14.480
do you plead guilty
and accept the punishment?

05:24.430 --> 05:25.310
Tian Benchang!

05:33.680 --> 05:35.340
I still have something to say.

05:37.920 --> 05:40.159
Do you want to talk about
Nanjing Garrison Commander

05:40.159 --> 05:41.520
to back you up, do you?

05:41.680 --> 05:43.070
I might as well tell you,

05:43.360 --> 05:46.120
Wu Ru accepted bribes,
colluded with foreign forces,

05:46.120 --> 05:47.580
and abused his authority.

05:47.750 --> 05:51.280
He has already been stripped of office
and placed under arrest.

05:51.390 --> 05:53.950
No one can save you today.

05:55.950 --> 05:56.950
Your Excellency,

05:59.920 --> 06:01.390
what I have to say

06:02.000 --> 06:04.720
has nothing to do
with Commander Wu or this case.

06:05.830 --> 06:07.120
What I want to say

06:07.600 --> 06:10.160
is the real culprit
behind the Tribute Ink Case of the Li family

06:10.160 --> 06:12.530
thirteen years ago.

06:14.430 --> 06:17.430
I have heard a bit about this,

06:18.310 --> 06:19.680
but it is an old story now.

06:19.680 --> 06:21.310
Why bring it up again?

06:21.680 --> 06:22.870
Thirteen years ago,

06:24.560 --> 06:26.070
Li Ink defeated Luo Ink

06:26.430 --> 06:27.950
and won the tribute ink contract.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.270
But while transporting
the Tribute Ink to the capital,

06:30.270 --> 06:32.270
a fire broke out

06:32.430 --> 06:33.890
after Li Jingfu got drunk.

06:34.240 --> 06:36.830
The entire shipment of Tribute Ink
was reduced to ashes.

06:36.830 --> 06:39.630
As a result, the Li family was severely
punished by the authorities.

06:39.630 --> 06:41.510
Li Jingdong lost the use of his leg,

06:41.510 --> 06:43.310
Li Jingqi died in prison,

06:43.950 --> 06:47.280
and Li Ink was burdened with ten years
of punitive taxation.

06:47.510 --> 06:49.600
After being punished, Li Jingfu suffered
a relapse of an old illness

06:49.600 --> 06:51.390
and died shortly after.

06:52.870 --> 06:55.930
Li Ink's vitality has been greatly damaged
since then.

06:56.360 --> 06:58.020
Does everyone still remember

06:59.159 --> 07:00.830
this public case?

07:04.950 --> 07:05.810
Tian Benchang,

07:06.510 --> 07:08.440
what on earth are you trying to say?

07:08.720 --> 07:09.510
Li Zhen,

07:10.390 --> 07:11.920
others may have forgotten,

07:12.430 --> 07:14.000
but I know

07:14.570 --> 07:16.550
you never did.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.160
That autumn,

07:19.430 --> 07:21.510
your branch of the family was cast out
and forced to relocate.

07:21.510 --> 07:23.270
Your father was gravely ill,

07:24.460 --> 07:25.490
and you had nowhere to turn for help.

07:25.490 --> 07:28.690
You could only stand by and watch him die
before your eyes.

07:30.480 --> 07:33.070
Poor you, only eight years old
at the time,

07:33.390 --> 07:36.050
having to endure the pain
of losing your father.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.120
Don't you hate them?

07:39.390 --> 07:40.390
Tian Benchang,

07:40.950 --> 07:43.480
stop struggling like a trapped beast.

07:43.480 --> 07:45.000
Whatever scheme you're trying
to pull is pointless.

07:45.000 --> 07:47.270
Our Li family has long since reconciled

07:47.360 --> 07:48.800
with the Eighth Branch.

07:49.159 --> 07:51.560
I won't allow you to sow discord here.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.720
Li Jingdong,

07:56.040 --> 07:56.720
you've been

08:00.360 --> 08:03.070
crippled for 13 years,

08:03.480 --> 08:06.410
and you've also hated the Eighth Branch
for 13 years.

08:06.750 --> 08:07.920
Over the years,

08:08.600 --> 08:12.600
how many obstacles have you secretly
placed in Li Zhen's family's path?

08:13.630 --> 08:14.890
Do you still remember?

08:15.600 --> 08:16.310
You!

08:18.870 --> 08:20.040
It's so ridiculous.

08:22.310 --> 08:24.040
You actually didn't know at all

08:26.310 --> 08:28.310
that you all hated the wrong person.

08:29.680 --> 08:30.630
All these years,

08:31.600 --> 08:33.080
the dispersion of the Li family

08:33.080 --> 08:34.480
and the downfall of Li Ink

08:35.200 --> 08:37.720
were actually a huge misunderstanding,

08:38.750 --> 08:40.390
and a massive injustice.

08:41.150 --> 08:41.960
Benchang,

08:42.750 --> 08:43.720
are you crazy?

08:46.790 --> 08:47.790
Your Excellency,

08:48.390 --> 08:51.360
my son is probably scared out of his wits.

08:51.600 --> 08:54.080
Please don't listen to his nonsense.

08:54.630 --> 08:55.360
What?

08:56.510 --> 08:57.200
Father,

08:58.790 --> 09:00.720
do you dare to do it but not admit it?

09:02.670 --> 09:03.600
Or are you

09:04.000 --> 09:06.030
afraid that if I expose everything,

09:06.240 --> 09:07.360
you'll be sentenced to death

09:07.360 --> 09:08.670
for all your crimes?

09:09.960 --> 09:10.910
Tian Benchang,

09:11.790 --> 09:13.750
what did you mean just now?

09:14.690 --> 09:16.320
Tell me everything in detail!

09:16.320 --> 09:18.200
Tell me everything in detail!

09:20.480 --> 09:21.210
Li Jingdong,

09:22.100 --> 09:23.460
step down at once.

09:24.120 --> 09:25.030
Uncle Jingdong,

09:25.030 --> 09:26.360
come back.

09:34.670 --> 09:37.000
Today, I will tell the truth

09:38.440 --> 09:39.970
about that Tribute Ink Case

09:41.030 --> 09:42.870
in front of everyone

09:43.870 --> 09:45.930
from the Li family and the Luo family.

09:50.670 --> 09:51.870
Thirteen years ago,

09:53.120 --> 09:55.370
the Li family defeated the Luo family's
Ziji Dragon Light Ink

09:55.370 --> 09:57.190
with their Way of Tao pine soot ink

09:57.190 --> 09:59.320
and secured the tribute ink contract.

10:00.720 --> 10:03.390
Luo Hanzhang was unwilling
to accept the defeat,

10:03.390 --> 10:07.360
and he had no way of explaining himself
to the powerful officials in court.

10:07.360 --> 10:08.150
So,

10:09.510 --> 10:11.030
he summoned my father

10:13.270 --> 10:14.360
and ordered him

10:14.360 --> 10:17.200
to travel to the capital alongside the Li family
convoy carrying the Tribute Ink,

10:17.200 --> 10:19.530
waiting for an opportunity to destroy it—

10:19.840 --> 10:21.970
so the Luo family could take its place.

10:24.600 --> 10:27.150
The fire back then was not caused
by Li Jingfu's drunken negligence at all.

10:27.150 --> 10:28.270
It was my father

10:28.750 --> 10:30.320
who used that incident as a cover,

10:30.320 --> 10:33.320
secretly infiltrated the Li family's
storage house,

10:33.460 --> 10:35.190
and set fire to the Tribute Ink.

10:51.790 --> 10:52.670
He's drugged?

10:52.700 --> 10:54.360
Don't worry, he won't wake up.

11:47.510 --> 11:48.240
Ink!

11:48.920 --> 11:49.800
Ink!

11:53.870 --> 11:54.870
Tian Benchang,

11:55.440 --> 11:56.910
stop talking nonsense!

11:57.240 --> 11:58.320
Say no more!

12:00.440 --> 12:01.390
Li Zhen,

12:02.320 --> 12:04.240
how can you still be so naive?

12:06.150 --> 12:07.390
If not,

12:07.750 --> 12:11.350
why would the Luo family help
Tian Ink after the Tribute Ink case,

12:11.360 --> 12:13.420
and help Tian Ink expand step by step?

12:15.200 --> 12:16.840
Even for my sister Ronghua,

12:17.640 --> 12:19.030
why would Luo Hanzhang agree

12:19.030 --> 12:20.890
to her engagement to Luo Wensong?

12:21.600 --> 12:22.480
Presumably,

12:22.480 --> 12:25.340
the Tribute Ink case
is also the reason behind this.

12:26.030 --> 12:26.910
Li Zhen,

12:28.870 --> 12:30.670
the one who killed your Li family

12:30.840 --> 12:32.370
was exactly the Luo family.

12:33.200 --> 12:35.460
It was Luo Wenqian's biological father,

12:37.150 --> 12:38.240
Luo Hanzhang.

12:38.510 --> 12:39.510
Nonsense!

12:45.080 --> 12:45.720
No.

12:46.630 --> 12:47.360
Impossible.

12:49.390 --> 12:50.200
Impossible.

12:51.000 --> 12:51.790
Impossible.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.210
Impossible.

13:01.720 --> 13:03.030
How dare you, Luo Wenqian!

13:03.030 --> 13:03.630
Zhen,

13:04.030 --> 13:05.430
it couldn't be my father.

13:05.540 --> 13:06.560
It really couldn't be my father.

13:06.560 --> 13:07.670
It really couldn't be my father.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.120
Not my father!

13:09.150 --> 13:10.360
Wenqian.

13:10.360 --> 13:10.870
You...

13:10.890 --> 13:11.560
Luo Wenqian.

13:11.560 --> 13:12.420
Tian Benchang!

13:12.870 --> 13:13.960
I don't believe

13:13.960 --> 13:15.320
every word you said!

13:18.390 --> 13:19.120
Lord He!

13:19.150 --> 13:19.840
Wenqian!

13:20.390 --> 13:21.550
Lord He,

13:21.870 --> 13:24.200
he is a dying man, Lord He!

13:24.390 --> 13:25.960
He is talking nonsense!

13:26.150 --> 13:28.000
Throw him into prison!

13:28.080 --> 13:28.750
Silence!

13:28.840 --> 13:29.600
Luo Wenqian,

13:29.910 --> 13:31.080
do not disrupt the court.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.030
Step down immediately!

13:32.030 --> 13:33.270
No, Zhen.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.440
Prefect He,

13:42.600 --> 13:43.680
I don't know

13:44.240 --> 13:45.510
what they just said.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.770
I have never harmed the Li family.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.030
He's framing me.

13:49.030 --> 13:49.840
Tian Huai'an,

13:50.720 --> 13:51.550
at this point,

13:51.550 --> 13:53.410
do you still think I know nothing?

13:53.790 --> 13:56.720
Every year you secretly transferred
300 taels of silver

13:56.720 --> 13:57.320
to a

13:57.320 --> 14:00.050
former employee
who no longer worked at Tian Ink.

14:01.030 --> 14:03.080
I went through a lot of trouble
to find him

14:03.080 --> 14:04.680
and investigated secretly.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.910
I learned that he was the helper

14:06.910 --> 14:09.240
who went to the capital
with you back then!

14:09.440 --> 14:10.750
You unfilial son!

14:10.960 --> 14:12.390
I'll beat you to death!

14:13.550 --> 14:14.030
I...

14:14.030 --> 14:15.000
Tian Huai'an!

14:15.510 --> 14:16.390
Lord He,

14:16.870 --> 14:18.840
you can summon this person
to the court for questioning,

14:18.840 --> 14:21.370
and then you will know
I am speaking the truth.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.240
You

14:40.550 --> 14:41.670
keep saying

14:41.670 --> 14:43.870
that I ruined the Huizhou Ink industry.

14:45.440 --> 14:47.600
Little do you know
that 13 years ago, this ink industry

14:47.600 --> 14:49.600
was already rotten to the core.

14:52.390 --> 14:54.550
I just want to live with dignity

14:54.790 --> 14:55.910
and live a better life.

14:55.910 --> 14:56.970
What did I do wrong?

14:58.850 --> 15:00.330
I was just like Lord Luo

15:00.360 --> 15:01.510
and my father—

15:01.510 --> 15:02.630
kneeling and climbing my way up!

15:02.630 --> 15:04.360
What did I do wrong?

15:06.960 --> 15:08.160
If there is any fault,

15:09.720 --> 15:13.630
it lies with everyone who has been driven
by the so-called "Tribute Ink" title,

15:13.630 --> 15:16.230
scrambling and scheming
for power and profit.

15:16.550 --> 15:17.390
You!

15:17.790 --> 15:18.630
You!

15:18.750 --> 15:19.390
You!

15:19.390 --> 15:19.870
You!

15:19.870 --> 15:21.360
All of you!

15:21.750 --> 15:22.870
All of you!

15:25.200 --> 15:26.200
All of you!

15:26.870 --> 15:27.790
All of you!

15:31.360 --> 15:32.200
Li Zhen.

15:34.870 --> 15:35.910
Luo Wenqian.

15:37.270 --> 15:38.440
I didn't lose.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.630
Your entanglement

15:42.750 --> 15:44.120
has only just begun.

15:48.510 --> 15:51.080
You two will never, ever be together.

15:51.200 --> 15:52.000
Forever.

15:57.240 --> 15:58.870
Just take your time enjoying

16:00.720 --> 16:03.320
the bitter fruit
of these past ten-plus years.

16:03.910 --> 16:04.870
Tian Benchang!

16:08.080 --> 16:09.610
Take him down immediately!

16:10.760 --> 16:12.000
Why?

16:12.240 --> 16:14.030
Why?

16:14.320 --> 16:16.360
Why?

16:20.960 --> 16:23.240
Why?

17:01.480 --> 17:02.150
Lord He,

17:03.600 --> 17:06.270
this concerns nearly 20 years

17:06.400 --> 17:09.750
of honor and downfall of the Li family.

17:10.440 --> 17:13.349
I beg you to thoroughly investigate

17:13.589 --> 17:16.480
and restore our family's innocence.

17:16.750 --> 17:17.480
Guards!

17:17.790 --> 17:20.069
Drag Tian Benchang and Tian Bensheng

17:20.240 --> 17:21.640
back to the prison first.

17:26.310 --> 17:28.240
As for Tian Huai'an,

17:28.790 --> 17:31.270
bring him to the constables

17:31.830 --> 17:33.430
for further interrogation.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.270
Court dismissed!

17:53.750 --> 17:55.280
Was it really the Luo family

17:55.350 --> 17:57.030
who did it back then?

17:57.680 --> 17:58.480
Eighth Uncle,

17:59.180 --> 18:00.210
don't worry yet.

18:00.590 --> 18:02.020
The prefectural office
is still investigating.

18:02.020 --> 18:04.050
Lord He said he'll send word

18:04.080 --> 18:06.560
as soon as there's news.

18:07.070 --> 18:08.270
But since

18:08.960 --> 18:11.720
Tian Benchang personally confessed,

18:12.160 --> 18:13.640
it's likely true.

18:15.550 --> 18:16.750
Everyone from Li Ink,

18:18.030 --> 18:20.160
I've been sent by the magistrate
to deliver a message.

18:20.160 --> 18:22.000
Tian Huai'an has already confessed.

18:22.000 --> 18:23.680
His accomplice from that year

18:23.680 --> 18:25.400
has also been arrested
and has admitted guilt.

18:25.400 --> 18:28.200
Everything Tian Benchang
said in court is true.

18:28.550 --> 18:31.240
Did Lord He say
how this case will be judged

18:31.790 --> 18:34.920
and how the grievances
of my Li family will be redressed?

18:35.880 --> 18:38.790
There is no one left in the Luo family
except Luo Wenqian,

18:38.790 --> 18:41.790
and he never participated in
the crime of destroying the Tribute Ink,

18:41.790 --> 18:44.250
so the original verdict remains unchanged.

18:44.350 --> 18:46.590
As for Tian Huai'an and that accomplice,

18:46.590 --> 18:48.790
they still need to be carefully convicted.

18:48.790 --> 18:50.270
But rest assured, everyone.

18:50.270 --> 18:51.920
Prefect He has drafted
an official document

18:51.920 --> 18:53.990
to the Directorate of Imperial Household
and Shuntian Prefecture.

18:53.990 --> 18:55.920
He has asked them
to cooperate with the investigation.

18:55.920 --> 18:58.720
They will definitely give you
all an explanation.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.310
Everyone,

19:00.750 --> 19:02.440
it's getting late. Farewell.

19:05.920 --> 19:06.850
Sister-in-law.

19:07.880 --> 19:08.810
Sister-in-law.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.400
Eighth Uncle,

19:38.880 --> 19:41.810
you have suffered so much grievance
all these years.

19:42.400 --> 19:45.750
On behalf of the entire Li family,
I, Jingdong,

19:46.350 --> 19:48.350
bow and apologize to you

19:49.880 --> 19:51.440
and the Eighth Branch!

20:21.640 --> 20:22.510
Jingfu,

20:23.350 --> 20:25.830
for all these years
when we came to pay respects,

20:25.830 --> 20:27.560
we haven't dared to bring wine.

20:27.720 --> 20:30.310
Today, your name is cleared.

20:31.880 --> 20:32.750
Father

20:33.000 --> 20:35.460
specially brought a pot
of good wine for you—

20:36.070 --> 20:37.440
drink your fill.

20:43.440 --> 20:44.720
My son, Jingfu.

20:45.920 --> 20:49.050
I'll drink with you today—
drink until we're satisfied.

20:55.750 --> 20:56.550
Drink up.

20:57.160 --> 21:00.020
Today, I will let you drink
to your heart's content.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.680
I know you were wronged.

21:04.270 --> 21:06.720
You must be thinking every day down there

21:06.720 --> 21:08.650
about the mistakes made back then.

21:09.440 --> 21:10.790
But from now on,

21:11.270 --> 21:13.270
you don't have to be afraid anymore.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.590
We came here today

21:18.720 --> 21:22.480
to clear your name once and for all

21:23.070 --> 21:26.110
and to make sure the King of Hell
and every spirit down below hear it—

21:26.110 --> 21:27.680
my husband, Li Jingfu,

21:29.790 --> 21:31.400
was not a criminal.

21:31.540 --> 21:35.000
[Li Jingfu's Tomb]

21:35.100 --> 21:36.190
From now on,

21:37.960 --> 21:40.200
if any wandering ghost

21:40.200 --> 21:41.460
dares look down on you,

21:42.680 --> 21:44.350
hold your head high

21:45.030 --> 21:46.550
and go back.

21:48.550 --> 21:49.550
Tell them

21:50.200 --> 21:51.400
that the Li family

21:51.920 --> 21:53.180
are upright and honest

21:53.750 --> 21:56.880
no matter where we are.

22:15.110 --> 22:16.030
Zhen,

22:16.510 --> 22:18.030
kowtow

22:18.640 --> 22:19.680
to your father

22:22.600 --> 22:24.200
together with your brother.

22:45.480 --> 22:46.160
Father,

22:47.590 --> 22:49.450
after finishing this jug of wine,

22:50.510 --> 22:52.170
you can finally rest in peace.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.410
Thank you for your trouble.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.480
Sister,

23:33.640 --> 23:36.500
have you learned anything
from the investigation?

23:45.350 --> 23:46.200
Brother,

23:47.400 --> 23:48.660
I made all these dishes

23:49.110 --> 23:50.790
the way you like them.

23:51.790 --> 23:52.830
Come and try them.

23:53.310 --> 23:54.710
And this is strong liquor

23:55.030 --> 23:56.880
brought from the north.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.830
It used to be

23:59.240 --> 24:01.040
your favorite drink in the army.

24:02.270 --> 24:04.200
I've already arranged everything

24:04.960 --> 24:07.960
at the mining camp in the southwest
where you'll be sent.

24:07.960 --> 24:11.020
Someone will be there to look after you
when you arrive.

24:23.350 --> 24:24.750
Tian Huai'an confessed,

24:26.310 --> 24:27.480
didn't he?

24:52.720 --> 24:53.680
Sister,

24:55.240 --> 24:56.240
have you seen

24:57.510 --> 24:59.000
Zhen these past few days?

25:03.680 --> 25:04.400
No.

25:05.680 --> 25:06.920
If you want to see her,

25:07.240 --> 25:08.590
I can help you.

25:11.000 --> 25:12.830
I have no face to see Zhen.

25:13.750 --> 25:15.440
Zhen is generous.

25:16.200 --> 25:18.160
She was able to forgive the main branch

25:18.160 --> 25:21.240
and help reconcile the Eighth Branch
with the rest of the family.

25:21.240 --> 25:24.480
She's not someone
who can't tell right from wrong.

25:26.350 --> 25:27.310
Your father

25:27.550 --> 25:29.640
committed an unforgivable wrong,

25:29.790 --> 25:31.270
but you are innocent.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.400
You shouldn't have to

25:32.400 --> 25:34.350
bear the blame for it.

25:38.160 --> 25:39.310
Sister,

25:45.830 --> 25:48.310
I know what kind of person Zhen is.

25:51.030 --> 25:53.440
The sin my father committed back then

25:54.160 --> 25:56.030
didn't just hurt Zhen,

25:56.750 --> 26:00.030
but also the entire Li family.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.790
How could I possibly

26:06.750 --> 26:09.510
ask her to choose between me

26:09.510 --> 26:11.830
and her family's pain?

26:14.310 --> 26:15.550
I also don't want to

26:16.750 --> 26:18.410
make things difficult for her

26:20.160 --> 26:21.620
by asking her to forgive me

26:23.880 --> 26:25.480
and forgive our Luo family.

26:27.750 --> 26:28.790
Sister,

26:31.270 --> 26:33.640
This is my fate.

26:36.960 --> 26:38.680
My fate...

26:50.030 --> 26:50.680
Brother.

26:50.790 --> 26:51.480
Sister.

26:51.480 --> 26:52.440
What are you doing?

26:52.440 --> 26:53.200
Sister,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.350
I have one request of you.

26:57.720 --> 26:58.920
From this day on,

27:00.350 --> 27:01.610
please look after Zhen

27:03.160 --> 27:04.400
and

27:05.960 --> 27:07.160
my lonely aunt

27:08.640 --> 27:10.480
for me.

27:14.960 --> 27:16.350
As for that brat Xiao Qi,

27:16.350 --> 27:17.880
if he can stay by your side,

27:17.880 --> 27:20.480
he will definitely be
much safer than with me.

27:25.160 --> 27:26.400
Of course.

27:27.830 --> 27:29.760
I would do it even if you didn't ask.

27:30.030 --> 27:32.090
I will stay in Huizhou for a few years,

27:33.030 --> 27:35.490
and I will definitely
take good care of them.

27:46.880 --> 27:47.790
Ever since

27:49.070 --> 27:50.800
I joined Marshal Qi's command,

27:52.400 --> 27:54.160
I have always been by your side,

27:54.400 --> 27:55.480
following you

27:55.830 --> 27:58.090
and learning how to do business from you.

27:58.720 --> 27:59.750
Although

28:00.640 --> 28:02.110
my family is scattered

28:03.030 --> 28:04.960
and my fate is full of misfortunes,

28:05.130 --> 28:07.400
it is exactly because of your care

28:08.070 --> 28:09.270
that I

28:10.270 --> 28:12.510
could feel the warmth of family.

28:20.070 --> 28:21.600
But I haven't had the chance

28:23.000 --> 28:26.200
to repay your kindness.

28:27.640 --> 28:28.510
Today,

28:30.200 --> 28:31.480
let me borrow your wine

28:32.550 --> 28:33.950
to express my gratitude.

28:43.680 --> 28:44.550
Sister,

28:46.720 --> 28:47.440
take care.

29:15.810 --> 29:17.920
Manager Zhen, Madam Wang is here.

29:20.270 --> 29:21.480
Sister Cuiqiao?

29:21.750 --> 29:22.950
What brings you here?

29:23.480 --> 29:24.740
Quick, serve some tea.

29:24.880 --> 29:25.680
No need.

29:26.680 --> 29:28.480
I just have a few words for you.

29:28.510 --> 29:29.770
I'll leave after that.

29:36.310 --> 29:38.640
The date for Wenqian's exile has been set.

29:38.720 --> 29:40.250
We'll depart in three days.

29:42.830 --> 29:44.640
He didn't want me to tell you,

29:45.240 --> 29:46.960
but after thinking it over,

29:47.240 --> 29:48.960
I felt you should know.

29:49.510 --> 29:51.750
As for everything
that happened in the past,

29:51.750 --> 29:53.480
how you choose to understand it

29:53.790 --> 29:55.550
and how you choose to move forward

29:55.550 --> 29:58.160
is entirely up to you.
I don't wish to interfere.

29:58.160 --> 29:59.590
But I have always seen

29:59.750 --> 30:01.150
the bond between you two,

30:02.000 --> 30:04.200
and I don't want you to have any regrets.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.920
Don't overthink it.

30:19.880 --> 30:21.200
In his heart,

30:21.790 --> 30:24.190
my brother has always been
thinking of you.

30:24.510 --> 30:26.770
If it's truly too hard for you
to face him,

30:27.400 --> 30:28.920
he won't blame you.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.290
Take care of yourself.

31:09.700 --> 31:11.350
It has now been established that

31:11.350 --> 31:13.350
Tian Benchang from Huizhou

31:13.720 --> 31:16.110
committed the grave crime
of colluding with foreign powers

31:16.110 --> 31:18.270
and was responsible for
the deaths of innocent civilians.

31:18.270 --> 31:21.070
The evidence is conclusive
and his crimes are beyond pardon.

31:21.070 --> 31:22.870
According to the laws of Ming,

31:23.160 --> 31:24.480
he shall be executed.

31:27.730 --> 31:29.500
His father, Tian Huai'an,

31:30.350 --> 31:33.200
knowingly concealed the crime
of collusion with foreign powers.

31:33.200 --> 31:35.350
Furthermore, 13 years ago,

31:35.400 --> 31:37.750
he framed the Li family of Huizhou
in the Imperial Tribute Ink Case,

31:37.750 --> 31:39.440
causing deaths and injuries
among the Li clan

31:39.440 --> 31:41.590
and costing them their Tribute Ink title.

31:41.590 --> 31:43.380
His crimes are likewise heinous

31:43.380 --> 31:44.050
and, by law,

31:44.210 --> 31:45.410
punishable by death.

31:46.720 --> 31:49.310
Under the order of the Emperor,

31:49.680 --> 31:51.160
he shall be sent to
the Ministry of Justice of Nanjing

31:51.160 --> 31:52.590
and publicly beheaded,

31:53.110 --> 31:55.550
so that the law
of the realm may be upheld.

32:14.550 --> 32:17.070
Order of
the Directorate of Imperial Household:

32:17.070 --> 32:19.720
the old Li Ink case has been vindicated,

32:20.300 --> 32:23.400
and the long-standing corruption
within Huizhou's ink industry

32:23.400 --> 32:24.920
has finally been swept away.

32:24.920 --> 32:27.350
However, with the Tian family disgraced

32:27.400 --> 32:29.220
and their Imperial Tribute Ink
privileges revoked,

32:29.220 --> 32:31.730
the court cannot go without Tribute Ink.

32:31.880 --> 32:33.790
After careful consideration,

32:33.850 --> 32:36.920
I hereby decree that Li Ink shall assume
the tribute ink contract

32:36.920 --> 32:39.550
until the next selection and evaluation,

32:39.550 --> 32:40.920
four years from now.

32:40.960 --> 32:43.820
By order
of the Directorate of Imperial Household.

32:47.160 --> 32:47.750
Li Zhen,

32:48.590 --> 32:50.920
this matter has reached the Inner Palace.

32:51.310 --> 32:53.510
In the end, it was decided by His Majesty

32:53.590 --> 32:56.750
that the Li family temporarily
assume the tribute ink contract.

32:56.750 --> 32:59.270
Such imperial grace
must not be taken lightly.

32:59.270 --> 33:01.880
Make sure you carry out this duty well.

33:10.310 --> 33:13.240
As head of Li Ink, I, Li Zhen,

33:13.720 --> 33:16.580
will lead the company
with diligence and integrity

33:16.790 --> 33:19.850
and will not fail the trust
His Majesty has placed in us.

33:26.830 --> 33:27.690
Hurry up and go.

33:38.510 --> 33:40.830
Aunt, I'm hungry.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.790
Zhengrun,

33:42.110 --> 33:43.070
don't be anxious.

33:43.070 --> 33:44.270
Wait a little longer.

33:44.350 --> 33:46.440
How about I take them to the kitchen

33:46.440 --> 33:47.480
and have some snacks?

33:47.480 --> 33:48.160
Sure.

33:51.030 --> 33:53.270
Let's go eat snacks, okay?

33:54.360 --> 33:56.560
Instead of keeping busy with your work,

33:57.270 --> 33:58.240
why do you insist

33:58.270 --> 34:00.330
on keeping me company while fishing?

34:01.480 --> 34:02.270
No,

34:02.480 --> 34:04.440
I just haven't spent time
with you for a long time,

34:04.440 --> 34:06.310
and wanted to go fishing with you.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.250
That's good too.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.880
Today, let's

34:15.110 --> 34:16.590
enjoy some good fishing.

34:18.000 --> 34:18.920
Grandpa,

34:19.510 --> 34:21.239
in this pool of stagnant water,

34:21.360 --> 34:22.800
the fish are trapped.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.400
Do you think

34:24.480 --> 34:25.960
they can swim out?

34:37.280 --> 34:38.550
Silly girl.

34:40.550 --> 34:42.400
There's always a way out.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.880
If there's a will,

34:52.840 --> 34:53.900
every living thing

34:55.480 --> 34:58.760
can find its own path.

35:01.840 --> 35:03.550
A rainfall

35:04.960 --> 35:06.280
or a snowfall

35:07.630 --> 35:09.630
can bring fresh water into the pond,

35:10.030 --> 35:13.800
and that fresh water
may lead the fish to a way out.

35:18.320 --> 35:20.030
People are like fish.

35:21.360 --> 35:23.800
We can't trap ourselves.

35:26.150 --> 35:27.000
We

35:27.760 --> 35:29.670
also need to rely on rain

35:30.400 --> 35:31.480
or snow

35:32.800 --> 35:34.280
to free ourselves

35:35.400 --> 35:36.550
from our pain.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.360
Right?

35:42.670 --> 35:43.320
Go ahead.

35:44.760 --> 35:47.630
I asked your mother
to leave you some food and dishes.

35:47.630 --> 35:49.290
Come back and have some early.

36:13.880 --> 36:15.880
I pay my respect to General Yu

36:18.230 --> 36:19.360
and my sister.

36:20.030 --> 36:21.150
Please rise.

36:22.030 --> 36:23.920
I am no general today.

36:24.150 --> 36:26.010
You don't need to bow so formally.

36:26.290 --> 36:28.490
Even setting military protocol aside,

36:29.030 --> 36:30.430
I still owe Uncle Yu a debt

36:30.550 --> 36:32.110
of gratitude for taking us in

36:32.110 --> 36:34.150
all those years ago.

36:36.480 --> 36:37.670
I know that

36:38.360 --> 36:40.360
I've done many wrong things lately.

36:41.510 --> 36:42.680
I hope Uncle Yu

36:44.110 --> 36:44.970
can forgive me.

36:49.920 --> 36:53.050
Take good care of yourself
when you reach the southwest.

36:53.670 --> 36:55.030
The world is vast.

36:55.230 --> 36:56.230
Even in exile,

36:56.440 --> 36:58.320
you must not lose your will.

36:58.920 --> 36:59.610
I

37:00.590 --> 37:02.050
will wait for your return.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.440
Young Master.

37:41.480 --> 37:42.360
Jixiang.

37:43.880 --> 37:48.400
From now on, we no longer need to
hide our names.

37:48.840 --> 37:49.970
This is a good thing.

37:50.960 --> 37:51.710
Don't cry.

37:55.000 --> 37:56.070
After I leave,

37:57.320 --> 37:59.590
you must listen well to General Yu

37:59.800 --> 38:00.960
and my sister.

38:03.070 --> 38:05.840
Help my sister take good care of our aunt.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.510
And the Li family

38:12.110 --> 38:13.670
has been kind to us.

38:14.970 --> 38:17.330
If one day they ever need any help,

38:18.230 --> 38:20.360
you must do your best to assist.

38:22.550 --> 38:23.950
Take care, Young Master.

38:32.000 --> 38:33.590
Officers,

38:35.480 --> 38:36.400
let's go.

38:39.110 --> 38:40.000
Brother,

38:43.480 --> 38:44.320
take care.

38:48.920 --> 38:50.400
Luo Wenqian!

39:14.630 --> 39:15.630
This journey

39:16.960 --> 39:18.420
will be full of hardships.

39:19.440 --> 39:20.710
I came to see you off.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.410
Take good care of yourself.

39:26.190 --> 39:27.030
You too.

39:28.280 --> 39:29.590
I heard the Li family

39:31.110 --> 39:33.840
has already taken over
the tribute ink contract.

39:33.840 --> 39:34.900
Congratulations.

39:35.760 --> 39:38.440
But the days ahead will be more tiring

39:39.760 --> 39:40.630
and harder.

39:42.230 --> 39:43.490
Take care of yourself.

39:44.510 --> 39:45.640
Don't work too hard.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.190
Zhen,

40:01.230 --> 40:02.630
it seems

40:03.360 --> 40:05.220
we were fated to meet in this life,

40:05.480 --> 40:06.740
but not to be together.

40:10.630 --> 40:12.280
I once naïvely believed that

40:13.150 --> 40:16.320
when my family's grievances
were finally settled,

40:18.400 --> 40:19.920
I could build a future

40:20.510 --> 40:22.510
with you.

40:24.110 --> 40:25.440
But I never imagined

40:26.550 --> 40:28.280
that the person I most wanted to

40:29.280 --> 40:30.190
protect

40:31.550 --> 40:32.800
and cherish

40:33.920 --> 40:36.670
had been so deeply hurt by my own family.

40:39.030 --> 40:39.960
Zhen,

40:42.070 --> 40:43.110
our Luo family

40:44.670 --> 40:45.630
owes you

40:47.190 --> 40:48.280
and the Li family.

40:50.550 --> 40:51.800
From now on,

40:52.360 --> 40:53.440
forget me

40:55.070 --> 40:56.510
and walk forward.

40:56.920 --> 40:57.880
Don't look back.

41:05.400 --> 41:06.330
Don't look back.

41:14.510 --> 41:15.440
You too.

41:17.320 --> 41:18.580
You survived the vast,

41:18.670 --> 41:19.920
desolate north.

41:20.710 --> 41:21.670
The southwest

41:22.150 --> 41:23.950
won't be able to hold you either.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.110
From now on,

41:26.600 --> 41:28.160
you can finally proudly

41:28.190 --> 41:29.920
tell everyone your name—

41:31.070 --> 41:32.150
Luo Wenqian.

41:36.960 --> 41:37.880
Luo Wenqian.

41:46.320 --> 41:47.670
I, Luo Wenqian,

41:48.360 --> 41:49.710
wish Li Ink

41:51.360 --> 41:53.110
prosperity

41:54.360 --> 41:55.920
and endless blessings.

41:57.550 --> 41:58.630
I also wish

42:00.480 --> 42:01.670
Miss Li Zhen

42:03.230 --> 42:04.280
a good marriage

42:05.510 --> 42:07.230
and a bright future.

42:08.590 --> 42:10.280
in this life.

42:15.590 --> 42:16.920
I have no regrets

42:18.510 --> 42:20.510
about meeting you in this lifetime.

42:32.590 --> 42:33.920
We part here.

42:51.030 --> 42:52.150
Take care!
